1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,130
Noah… Ilyas… you are brothers.

2
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:14,090
Tell me: If one of you has to do something difficult, does the other one help then?

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,850
Sure! Ilyas always helps me with my homework!

4
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,250
That is nice, my sweetheart.

5
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,090
Cuddle up

6
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:31,030
Today I will tell you about two brothers who were both prophets:

7
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:36,430
Musa and his brother Harun, peace be upon them.

8
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,930
And today it is about Harun.

9
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,290
Do you remember?

10
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:46,990
At the fire on the mountain, Allah said to Musa:

11
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:53,270
Go to Pharaoh! That was a very difficult task.

12
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,390
And Musa prayed:

13
00:00:57,180 --> 00:01:01,830
My Lord, give me a helper from my family:

14
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,970
Harun, my brother.

15
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:11,790
Make me strong through him and let him join me in my task.

16
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:15,090
Why did Musa want Harun specifically?

17
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:21,910
Musa said: My brother Harun can speak better than I can.

18
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:28,130
Send him with me so that he helps me and confirms what I say.

19
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,610
And Allah answered:

20
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:35,270
We will make you strong through your brother!

21
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:40,350
Allah made Harun a prophet as well.

22
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:43,670
A gift from His mercy.

23
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:47,970
Then Allah said to the two brothers:

24
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:53,970
Go to Pharaoh, for he has transgressed all bounds.

25
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,670
And speak gently to him, perhaps he will reflect.

26
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,210
Musa and Harun said:

27
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:06,370
Our Lord, we are afraid.

28
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,990
And Allah said:

29
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:10,730
Do not be afraid!

30
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:16,730
I am with you, I hear and I see.

31
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,930
So they went there together?

32
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:25,850
Like a team! Exactly, like a team.

33
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:33,830
They went together to Pharaoh, and they stuck together, even when it became difficult.

34
00:02:34,820 --> 00:02:39,970
And Allah saved them and the Children of Israel at the sea.

35
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:43,450
I told you that last time.

36
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:51,210
After the rescue, Allah called Musa to Himself for forty nights, to the mountain.

37
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:56,270
Before Musa left, he said to Harun:

38
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:59,270
Take my place among my people.

39
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:05,410
Do everything right and do not follow those who cause mischief.

40
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:11,110
But while Musa was away, a man named Samiri made out of the people's gold jewelry

41
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:14,570
a golden calf that made a sound.

42
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:17,550
And he said: This is your god!

43
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,730
And many people believed him.

44
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,730
A calf made of gold?

45
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:25,370
That cannot be a god!

46
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,830
You are right, my sweetheart.

47
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:31,430
And that is exactly what Harun said.

48
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:38,690
He cried: My people, you are only being tested by this!

49
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,870
Your Lord is the Most Merciful.

50
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:45,710
Follow me and listen to me!

51
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,430
But they said:

52
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:52,830
We will not stop until Musa returns.

53
00:03:53,840 --> 00:04:01,710
When Musa returned and saw what had happened, he became very sad and angry.

54
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:09,110
He thought Harun had not paid enough attention, and grabbed him by the head.

55
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:13,770
Oh no! Was Harun mad at him then?

56
00:04:14,220 --> 00:04:15,850
No, my sweetheart.

57
00:04:16,580 --> 00:04:20,330
Harun stayed completely calm and said lovingly:

58
00:04:21,060 --> 00:04:24,370
Son of my mother, let go of me!

59
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,970
I was afraid that you would say:

60
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,950
You have divided the Children of Israel.

61
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,230
The people did not listen to me.

62
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:40,130
Then Musa understood that his brother had done everything right.

63
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:52,070
And he prayed: My Lord, forgive me and my brother, and let us enter into Your mercy.

64
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:58,650
You are the Most Merciful of the merciful.

65
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:03,010
Allah praises the two brothers in the Quran.

66
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:06,010
He says: Peace be upon Musa and Harun!

67
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:08,610
They were among His believing servants.

68
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:13,730
Did our Prophet Muhammad also tell about Harun?

69
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:22,130
Yes! When our Prophet Muhammad, peace and blessings be upon him,

70
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:30,630
once went on a journey, he left his cousin Ali behind to watch over the family.

71
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:33,510
And he said to him:

72
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:39,110
Are you not happy to be to me as Harun was to Musa?

73
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:42,950
Except that after me there will be no more prophet.

74
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:46,350
Oh… they are already asleep.

75
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:50,210
My dear ones… stick together like Musa and Harun.

76
00:05:50,260 --> 00:05:53,090
Help each other when something is difficult.

77
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:55,910
Speak the truth, even if many do something wrong.

78
00:05:55,960 --> 00:06:01,310
And if someone misunderstands you, stay friendly and explain it calmly.

79
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:07,430
And next time I will tell you about Dhul-Kifl,

80
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:15,370
a prophet about whom the Quran says only a few words, but very special ones.

81
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:20,210
And you, who are watching right now:

82
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:27,410
If you liked the story, ask your parents if they will subscribe to our channel.

83
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:32,430
That way you won't miss the next story.

84
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,550
Sleep well, my dear ones.

85
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,990
May Allah protect you.
